            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this salad for a pre-holiday dinner party and it was a big success! Very delicious with a variety of textures and flavors. My husband said his “taste buds were dancing”. I used half spinach, half spring mix, and goat cheese, along with all the other listed ingredients. Definitely five stars!",
